{
  "type": "doc",
  "content": [
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "attrs": { "level": 1 },
      "content": [
        { "type": "text", "text": "Heidi Negotiates With the Alps" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The Swiss Alps did not ask for a publicist, but they got Heidi anyway. Somewhere between a cowbell and a postcard, she is still winning the argument about fresh air in "
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "marks": [
            {
              "type": "link",
              "attrs": {
                "href": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Swiss_Alps",
                "target": "_blank",
                "rel": "noopener noreferrer",
                "class": "link"
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "Switzerland"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "marks": [{ "type": "italic" }],
          "text": "The meadow is complimentary. The cheese takes itself very seriously."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "attrs": {
        "src": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/60/Matterhorn_from_Domh%C3%BCtte_-_2.jpg/960px-Matterhorn_from_Domh%C3%BCtte_-_2.jpg",
        "alt": "The Matterhorn, looking as if it practiced this pose",
        "title": "Matterhorn",
        "fileName": null
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "attrs": { "level": 2 },
      "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "A short field guide" }]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Heidi's office has excellent views and questionable management. Bring layers, and do not argue with the goats."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "bulletList",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "listItem",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "marks": [{ "type": "bold" }],
                  "text": "Matterhorn"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": " — the mountain that refuses to sit up straight, and knows it."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "listItem",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "A meadow with a job description. Heidi clocks in. The wildflowers do not."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "listItem",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "One thermos. Even a wholesome Alpine story eventually needs coffee."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "blockquote",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "marks": [{ "type": "bold" }],
              "text": "Local guide:"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " If you yodel, the echo yodels back. That is not encouragement. That is acoustics."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "horizontalRule"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Heidi would like the record to show that the Alps are lovely, the goats believe they are in charge, and the mountains already scheduled that pleasantly small feeling before breakfast."
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
